# DL / Vision Paper To Code

1. Extract architecture, losses, augmentation, schedule, and metric protocol.
2. Separate mandatory reproduction details from optional improvements.
3. Map paper concepts to model, data, training, eval, and reporting code.
4. Build a baseline + ablation matrix.
5. Define verification criteria before implementation.
